Thanks so much Stephen for your comments. You are right, there was a mistake in study area surface. I should have modeled with 300 ha, not 30 ha. That predicts 1268 birds. The total observed birds were 961. However, with an average p of 0.53, I would expect more predicted birds. The cv is 0.3, so that may be the issue..right?

